1
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:15,950
With the support of the Japan Football Federation

2
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:18,590
...How annoying.

3
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:23,640
...As expected, they put that antenna bastard in the game.

4
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,350
Wow?

5
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:32,180
You look pretty fired up, little lower-lash.

6
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:35,300
But your explosion ends here!

7
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:41,270
Let's decide who's number one today, Rin-chan! Kiss!

8
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:43,980
Hey...! Stop, Shidou!

9
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:47,050
Of course... you came right on time.

10
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:53,690
I needed a figurant to add an aesthetic touch to my match, you yellow-haired pest.

11
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:58,520
I could say the same to you...! You little brat clinging to your big brother!

12
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:05,000
...It appears that Shidou Ryusei came on at the start of the second half, replacing Wakatsuki.

13
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,030
However, we have no information about him!

14
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:09,540
I wonder what kind of playing style he will show us...?

15
00:01:09,910 --> 00:01:11,360
I can't wait to see!

16
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:17,220
...I'm sure the situation on the pitch will change with Shidou's entry.

17
00:01:18,050 --> 00:01:23,780
...And whoever adapts to this change first... will become the hero of this match!

18
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:27,710
...Reacting... flow.

19
00:01:28,270 --> 00:01:30,500
I won't let this match end without scoring a goal!

20
00:01:31,030 --> 00:01:33,900
The second half is about to start!

21
00:01:34,490 --> 00:01:35,830
...This match...

22
00:01:36,460 --> 00:01:37,620
...is mine!!!

23
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:24,810
...Shidou-kun's weapon is his ability to score from anywhere inside the penalty area.

24
00:03:24,810 --> 00:03:26,960
...I must not let him out of my sight.

25
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:31,990
...The critical moment will be when he receives the ball in front of the goal.

26
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:35,610
...That's when I'll pounce on him from the last line of defense!

27
00:03:35,610 --> 00:03:37,690
...Pulse... and vitality!

28
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,100
I'm the one who will infiltrate!

29
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:41,610
Has he gone crazy...?

30
00:03:41,610 --> 00:03:43,610
W-What on earth are these movements...?

31
00:03:43,610 --> 00:03:45,830
...He's ignoring the formation of both the opponent and his own team!

32
00:03:50,830 --> 00:03:51,880
Are you serious...?

33
00:03:52,390 --> 00:03:54,710
...His movements even confuse his own team!

34
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:58,050
...For him, this isn't 11 vs 11.

35
00:03:58,810 --> 00:04:01,010
...It's 1 vs 21!

36
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:05,090
...Th-This is impossible.

37
00:04:05,090 --> 00:04:07,810
...Normally, a pass isn't made through such a narrow space!

38
00:04:07,810 --> 00:04:09,520
Great!

39
00:04:09,850 --> 00:04:11,480
No! I can catch up!

40
00:04:12,980 --> 00:04:15,300
Being fast really pays off!

41
00:04:15,300 --> 00:04:16,150
Shidou!

42
00:04:17,390 --> 00:04:18,860
Sendou...?

43
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:21,240
So you understood, you clingy bastard!

44
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,400
...Shut up.

45
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:25,410
I'm just moving as Itoshi Sae told me to!

46
00:04:25,690 --> 00:04:28,030
...He's different from the first half!

47
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:31,660
...He's become a decoy supporting Shidou!

48
00:04:31,710 --> 00:04:36,420
...In short... they're just like Rin and Isagi.

49
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:40,960
...Damn! We hadn't accounted for this chemistry!

50
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:45,380
If it's for the win... I'll do as I'm told!

51
00:04:45,380 --> 00:04:47,090
Now a sideways pass...?

52
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,060
What a disaster!

53
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:52,270
...The one waiting for it at the edge of the penalty area...

54
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:54,000
Itoshi Sae!

55
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:57,300
Here he comes!

56
00:05:00,850 --> 00:05:02,190
Is he going to take a direct shot...?

57
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:04,570
Could he be doing this on reflex...?

58
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:10,740
...No... this isn't a shot.

59
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:15,750
...A precise pass with the outside of his foot!

60
00:05:15,750 --> 00:05:17,790
Here's your pass, you demon child.

61
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,950
I love exciting people!

62
00:05:20,310 --> 00:05:24,050
...Shidou's entry has tremendously improved their attack!

63
00:05:26,370 --> 00:05:27,670
This is bad!

64
00:05:27,670 --> 00:05:31,810
The Japan U-20 players... are awakening!

65
00:05:31,810 --> 00:05:33,890
...No...! The ball is still...

66
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:35,930
...within my defensive zone!

67
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,310
Niko?

68
00:05:40,810 --> 00:05:43,030
Thanks, Niko!

69
00:05:43,980 --> 00:05:46,860
Wow! That was a dangerous tackle!

70
00:05:46,860 --> 00:05:50,200
Blue Lock player Niko Ikki receives a yellow card!

71
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:52,860
But it was an incredible move!

72
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:58,290
Number 13... that player called Shidou... managed to link up with Itoshi Sae!

73
00:05:59,030 --> 00:06:02,750
...You bastard with bangs!

74
00:06:03,010 --> 00:06:05,840
I apologize for stepping on you, Mr. Pest.

75
00:06:06,550 --> 00:06:07,930
You're on the death list!

76
00:06:07,930 --> 00:06:09,970
Calm down, idiot.

77
00:06:11,470 --> 00:06:14,100
Do you want to get sent off and end your career with your own hands?

78
00:06:14,490 --> 00:06:16,780
Prove yourself by scoring.

79
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:19,980
Don't disappoint me any further.

80
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:23,880
Thanks for your concern!

81
00:06:25,710 --> 00:06:27,630
Good job keeping up with him, Niko!

82
00:06:27,630 --> 00:06:29,150
Well defended!

83
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:32,700
...But I couldn't stop him without committing a foul.

84
00:06:34,330 --> 00:06:37,190
...Itoshi Sae's movement and Shidou-kun's off-the-ball runs...

85
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:42,580
...I was able to read both accurately and determine where the pass would go.

86
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:45,360
...But despite that...

87
00:06:45,850 --> 00:06:46,920
...Niko.

88
00:06:47,660 --> 00:06:49,620
Sendou-kun messed things up.

89
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:55,370
...He was following Shidou-kun's movements and appearing at the worst moments.

90
00:06:55,370 --> 00:06:59,940
...That delayed my decision for a moment and cost me a yellow card.

91
00:07:00,550 --> 00:07:04,080
...Sendou-kun changed his playing style as soon as Shidou-kun entered the field.

92
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:10,200
...He may not be a major threat... but his presence is causing us trouble right now.

93
00:07:10,770 --> 00:07:13,460
He was able to see all that...?

94
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,380
Are you okay?

95
00:07:17,380 --> 00:07:19,580
Did you hurt your foot in that last challenge?

96
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:21,390
...Please leave me alone.

97
00:07:21,390 --> 00:07:22,420
...I can keep playing.

98
00:07:23,830 --> 00:07:25,500
More precisely, I want to keep playing!

99
00:07:27,390 --> 00:07:30,290
...Not being selected as a forward was disappointing, but...

100
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:35,100
...With these eyes of mine and what I did in the last attack, I realized a little.

101
00:07:36,050 --> 00:07:40,270
...The pleasure of playing as a defender and crushing other forwards!

102
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,480
Isagi-kun.

103
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:51,350
...Ever since I first met you, my fear of change has disappeared.

104
00:07:53,520 --> 00:07:56,230
...We will definitely win this match!

105
00:07:56,940 --> 00:07:57,700
Absolutely!

106
00:08:02,430 --> 00:08:06,130
Look, look! A free kick and Sae-kun is on the ball!

107
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:11,170
Who exactly is that number 13?

108
00:08:11,170 --> 00:08:13,590
Of course Itoshi Sae will take this foul!

109
00:08:15,110 --> 00:08:17,860
Get out of this without conceding, Blue Lock!

110
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:22,950
I'll take it, Sae-chan!

111
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:28,320
Your annoying brother is blocking the path you want to shoot!

112
00:08:29,660 --> 00:08:31,250
The wall is tight and their players are gathered in front of the goal.

113
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:34,820
There's no place for you to shoot either.

114
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:40,200
Shut up! I drew the foul, so I'll strike the ball!

115
00:08:41,650 --> 00:08:43,680
Is this the best you could come up with?

116
00:08:45,460 --> 00:08:50,130
I'm asking if this is the best option your eyes can see.

117
00:08:52,390 --> 00:08:57,300
...The play that is realistically possible and the ideal play you want.

118
00:08:57,810 --> 00:09:00,850
Aim for the borderline between them.

119
00:09:01,250 --> 00:09:03,060
...Don't stop your inspiration.

120
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:09,260
Imagine the best goal you can score right now.

121
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:15,050
You're giving me goosebumps, Sae-chan!

122
00:09:15,050 --> 00:09:18,320
An amazing move just popped into my head!

123
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:22,390
...But it's extremely absurd, even beyond absurdity!

124
00:09:22,390 --> 00:09:24,190
Can you keep up with it?

125
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,120
Who do you think I am?!

126
00:09:27,910 --> 00:09:29,630
...You dream, demon, and I'll...

127
00:09:30,180 --> 00:09:32,800
...cast my magic.

128
00:09:33,330 --> 00:09:36,680
Wow! Am I Cinderella?

129
00:09:37,700 --> 00:09:39,260
You're making my heart flutter!

130
00:09:41,810 --> 00:09:43,310
He's moved! Here it comes!

131
00:09:43,860 --> 00:09:46,480
The one taking the kick... is Shidou!

132
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,320
He ran past the ball and kept running...?

133
00:09:51,650 --> 00:09:53,210
A feint...?

134
00:09:53,210 --> 00:09:54,150
...The real kicker is...

135
00:09:55,570 --> 00:09:57,030
Itoshi Sae!

136
00:09:58,110 --> 00:09:59,570
No! This is wrong!

137
00:09:59,570 --> 00:10:03,290
You're aiming for the open space, aren't you, antenna freak?

138
00:10:03,290 --> 00:10:05,750
My top speed will get there before you!

139
00:10:05,750 --> 00:10:07,540
I'll stop you!

140
00:10:17,050 --> 00:10:19,430
I've read what you're trying to do!

141
00:10:20,230 --> 00:10:22,430
If I jump to head it, I can just about intercept it!

142
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,180
...I reached...

143
00:10:28,020 --> 00:10:29,230
I didn't reach it...?

144
00:10:29,230 --> 00:10:30,810
...This is impossible.

145
00:10:30,810 --> 00:10:35,570
Did he intentionally place the ball a few centimeters beyond my reach...?

146
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:39,240
Incredible...! Right on target!

147
00:10:41,730 --> 00:10:45,140
Fly... my cells!

148
00:10:46,770 --> 00:10:49,770
Falling Dragon Shot!

149
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:52,170
...You monster!

150
00:10:52,550 --> 00:10:53,670
Are you serious...?

151
00:10:54,310 --> 00:10:58,420
...So this is the result of the genius Itoshi Sae's synergy.

152
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:04,830
...And the devil Shidou Ryusei's!

153
00:11:06,620 --> 00:11:09,050
Yesssss!!!!

154
00:11:09,050 --> 00:11:11,020
This is insane!! Did you see that?

155
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:13,980
What was that?! Incredible!

156
00:11:13,980 --> 00:11:16,040
Amazing...! What was that just now...?

157
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:16,790
Damn!

158
00:11:17,230 --> 00:11:20,230
That crazy bastard!

159
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:30,370
...Wow! Japan U-20's number 13, Shidou Ryusei...

160
00:11:32,930 --> 00:11:36,180
...equalizes with a tremendous goal!!!

161
00:11:39,780 --> 00:11:42,550
You two really suit each other.

162
00:11:42,900 --> 00:11:45,170
...My brain is at its peak!

163
00:11:45,170 --> 00:11:48,560
The ecstasy is killing me!

164
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:52,020
The score is still tied, you clumsy devil.

165
00:11:53,770 --> 00:11:55,610
...That goal was incredible!

166
00:11:55,610 --> 00:11:59,110
...That was the synergy of Itoshi Sae and Shidou Ryusei.

167
00:12:00,250 --> 00:12:03,570
...The tactic on that foul was brilliant.

168
00:12:04,210 --> 00:12:09,240
...Shidou probably ran at full speed, imagining the ball coming there.

169
00:12:09,780 --> 00:12:12,290
...And Chigiri read that and went to intercept the pass.

170
00:12:12,850 --> 00:12:14,420
...But Itoshi Sae...

171
00:12:14,830 --> 00:12:18,670
...Chigiri's speed... the spot Shidou wanted the pass...

172
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:21,670
...and assessed the speed and accuracy of his own pass.

173
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:27,480
...In an instant, he threaded the pass like a needle!

174
00:12:30,660 --> 00:12:33,150
...He grasped everything in a flash.

175
00:12:33,500 --> 00:12:37,800
Isn't this that reflexive play I've been trying to master...?

176
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:41,650
...And the same goes for Shidou's volley.

177
00:12:42,490 --> 00:12:46,220
...His body had to react reflexively to execute the shot.

178
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:48,500
...This is a synergy of reflexes!

179
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:55,210
...What made that goal possible was the synergy of Itoshi Sae and Shidou Ryusei's extraordinary movements!

180
00:12:55,830 --> 00:12:59,070
...While no player in Blue Lock could understand Shidou's imagination,

181
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:03,070
Itoshi Sae clearly understood it and delivered a perfect pass!

182
00:13:03,660 --> 00:13:08,240
What's more... this is just the beginning for the two of them!

183
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:11,730
That was a great pass, big lower-lash! I'm impressed!

184
00:13:11,730 --> 00:13:13,550
Give me your number later!

185
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,900
I'll think about it if you score a hat-trick.

186
00:13:16,900 --> 00:13:19,310
You heard what came out of your mouth! You'd better keep your word!

187
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:24,720
...If we can't stop them, they'll turn the score around and win the match.

188
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:28,420
Chigiri!

189
00:13:32,890 --> 00:13:34,150
Are you okay?

190
00:13:34,630 --> 00:13:37,620
...Yeah... just a slight pull.

191
00:13:39,460 --> 00:13:41,660
...Even though there's still a lot of time left...

192
00:13:44,370 --> 00:13:45,970
...Bad things come in threes.

193
00:13:47,470 --> 00:13:52,350
...One of our center-backs got a card and hurt his ankle in the last tackle.

194
00:13:52,890 --> 00:13:57,100
...And our full-back, who sprinted at full speed both in attack and defense, has run out of steam.

195
00:13:57,580 --> 00:14:03,150
...And the situation of Japan U-20 has changed, thanks to Itoshi Sae and Shidou Ryusei.

196
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:07,410
Time for substitutions!

197
00:14:08,340 --> 00:14:09,610
Understood.

198
00:14:09,610 --> 00:14:11,370
Who will we bring on?

199
00:14:11,370 --> 00:14:13,250
...Our balance is off.

200
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:16,790
...So we need someone who can get into the game quickly.

201
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:19,250
...In other words, they are the ones who need to come in.

202
00:14:21,250 --> 00:14:22,960
Your knee is fine, right?

203
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:25,530
Yeah... sorry.

204
00:14:25,530 --> 00:14:27,920
...It's still early in the second half, but I...

205
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:33,020
...Did my strength run out after just this much effort...?! All because I kept skipping training!

206
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:39,160
...That past of mine, when I tried to run away to give up on football...

207
00:14:40,590 --> 00:14:43,720
...came back to make me pay at such a critical moment!

208
00:14:44,230 --> 00:14:45,650
...How pathetic I am!

209
00:14:47,420 --> 00:14:53,790
...If only... I had kept running more.

210
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:58,380
...Chigiri... you did your part.

211
00:15:00,210 --> 00:15:01,300
Damn it!

212
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:06,140
...And I was just starting to have a little fun.

213
00:15:07,170 --> 00:15:11,050
It seems the Blue Lock team will make substitutions!

214
00:15:11,050 --> 00:15:12,760
Two players will come on at the same time!

215
00:15:13,140 --> 00:15:17,720
...Number 4 Chigiri Hyoma and number 3 Niko Ikki are coming off.

216
00:15:18,130 --> 00:15:23,440
And number 14 Mikage Reo and number 16 Hiori Yo are entering the game!

217
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:30,340
You did a good job, Niko.

218
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:32,280
I leave the rest to you.

219
00:15:33,690 --> 00:15:36,280
You ran well, Chigiri-kun.

220
00:15:36,810 --> 00:15:38,240
Get a good rest.

221
00:15:40,990 --> 00:15:42,960
Your run was amazing, number 4!

222
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:46,170
You did a great job, Hyoma!!

223
00:15:51,580 --> 00:15:53,810
Hey, you! What's with that expression on your face?

224
00:15:55,670 --> 00:15:59,630
Are you objecting to the substitution, Chigiri Hyoma?

225
00:16:00,990 --> 00:16:03,880
...No... I'm not objecting.

226
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:09,160
...If you're going to cry,

227
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:13,280
you should have entered the pitch with a body capable of running until the final whistle, you idiot.

228
00:16:14,510 --> 00:16:19,470
...That regret you're feeling now... is what you deserve at your current level.

229
00:16:22,740 --> 00:16:25,260
...And now that Blue Lock has made two substitutions,

230
00:16:25,260 --> 00:16:27,250
I see there's also a change in positions!

231
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:28,520
You're right!

232
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:32,340
Right now, the momentum is in favor of Japan U-20!

233
00:16:32,590 --> 00:16:39,220
With these changes, ten minutes into the second half, let's see what their playing style will be like!

234
00:16:39,740 --> 00:16:41,690
You'll drop back and play as full-back, Otoya-kun.

235
00:16:41,690 --> 00:16:43,480
It's fine if you don't push up too much.

236
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,790
Okay, okay.

237
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:47,440
...I'm finally back!

238
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:51,090
...To the place where he is!

239
00:16:52,580 --> 00:16:53,380
Nagi!

240
00:16:55,490 --> 00:16:56,450
Am I late?

241
00:17:04,380 --> 00:17:07,080
Not at all! I was sure you'd come!

242
00:17:10,130 --> 00:17:11,800
Score another goal!

243
00:17:12,330 --> 00:17:14,320
Your level is higher than this!

244
00:17:14,320 --> 00:17:16,510
...Yeah... I know.

245
00:17:17,080 --> 00:17:18,920
If we don't win, everything will end.

246
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:23,730
...For us... it's too early to end!

247
00:17:24,100 --> 00:17:26,430
Yeah... I know.

248
00:17:28,470 --> 00:17:30,110
The score is still tied.

249
00:17:30,550 --> 00:17:33,440
...The next goal... will determine control of the match.

250
00:17:34,750 --> 00:17:35,680
...This...

251
00:17:38,050 --> 00:17:40,120
...is the turning point of this match!

252
00:17:42,490 --> 00:17:45,630
...With Hiori coming in, we'll change our plan.

253
00:17:46,150 --> 00:17:50,340
This is one of the attacking plans we've worked on!

254
00:17:51,210 --> 00:17:54,710
...Until now, we were all moving centered around Rin.

255
00:17:54,930 --> 00:17:59,350
...We were constantly, endlessly trying to show off our individual skills.

256
00:18:00,260 --> 00:18:04,560
...But Hiori's strengths are his calm vision and delicate touch on the ball.

257
00:18:05,370 --> 00:18:08,810
...He's a calm player who creates chances in attack!

258
00:18:08,810 --> 00:18:11,840
Your path is blocked, little sky-blue-haired!

259
00:18:13,020 --> 00:18:15,850
It's no problem for me, tattooed man.

260
00:18:16,180 --> 00:18:18,610
...I'm neither a ninja nor a sprinter.

261
00:18:19,130 --> 00:18:20,770
So I fight in other ways!

262
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:28,410
...What's expected of Hiori isn't to beat his opponent one-on-one.

263
00:18:28,410 --> 00:18:32,540
...It's to set up a perfect pass in sync with our movements!

264
00:18:33,180 --> 00:18:35,210
...Being direct,

265
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:38,360
is not the only type of egoism.

266
00:18:40,670 --> 00:18:42,460
So fast...! With the outside...?

267
00:18:42,460 --> 00:18:43,430
...What a narrow space he passed into!

268
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:47,270
A pass from such a tight angle...? You're so provocative!

269
00:18:47,750 --> 00:18:49,980
As usual, is it only your passes that are great?

270
00:18:49,980 --> 00:18:51,350
Passing isn't the only thing I'm great at!

271
00:18:51,350 --> 00:18:54,230
Then come and show me... what makes you special.

272
00:18:55,730 --> 00:18:58,440
...What a talkative crow you are.

273
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:02,160
...Those short passes surprised them!

274
00:19:03,130 --> 00:19:05,200
...And in this moment they created to free up Hiori,

275
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:09,270
...I have to react reflexively to Hiori's calmness and the precision of his left foot!

276
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:13,040
Then... shall we begin?

277
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:21,050
A crazy curled pass just like Itoshi Sae's!

278
00:19:21,050 --> 00:19:23,100
Its target... is Itoshi Rin!

279
00:19:24,100 --> 00:19:25,080
Or the one behind him...?

280
00:19:26,070 --> 00:19:28,060
What a great pass, Hiorin!

281
00:19:28,060 --> 00:19:29,390
You cheeky bastard!

282
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:34,110
Say that after you get past me, you ball-trapping punk!

283
00:19:35,390 --> 00:19:37,650
...What an annoying Doberman!

284
00:19:37,650 --> 00:19:40,280
...I used Rin as a decoy to slip behind!

285
00:19:41,820 --> 00:19:43,200
The ball is almost coming to me!

286
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:44,930
...Damn! What should I do...?

287
00:19:45,410 --> 00:19:46,460
...I'll jump anyway!

288
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:50,580
...I have no choice but to knock it into that space!

289
00:19:50,980 --> 00:19:53,410
...I know you sense it!

290
00:19:54,900 --> 00:19:56,010
...Forward!

291
00:19:57,080 --> 00:20:00,670
...The opportunity I was waiting for in Rin's shadow has come!

292
00:20:01,570 --> 00:20:02,630
...I won't control it.

293
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:04,970
...I'll take a direct sho-

294
00:20:04,970 --> 00:20:06,470
Little thief!

295
00:20:09,870 --> 00:20:12,140
I'm here to handcuff you!

296
00:20:13,490 --> 00:20:14,710
Aiku?

297
00:20:15,150 --> 00:20:16,650
Why are you here?

298
00:20:17,260 --> 00:20:22,740
...We just changed our formation... and this is an improvised back pass from Nagi!

299
00:20:23,350 --> 00:20:26,490
...Despite that, even though I was the first to react, he got there before me!

300
00:20:27,420 --> 00:20:31,790
...As long as I'm within his range... my abilities will be nullified!

301
00:20:32,120 --> 00:20:33,500
Damn it!

302
00:20:33,500 --> 00:20:34,710
Watch out for the counter!

303
00:20:34,930 --> 00:20:36,290
As expected from our captain!

304
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:38,250
I'm counting on you, genius!

305
00:20:39,490 --> 00:20:40,130
Here it comes!

306
00:20:40,930 --> 00:20:42,260
Watch out for the pass to Shidou!

307
00:20:42,690 --> 00:20:44,130
We'll stop him here!

308
00:20:44,640 --> 00:20:46,590
Let's go, Reo!

309
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:49,810
Listen well, Mikage Reo.

310
00:20:50,780 --> 00:20:53,270
...There's only one reason I'm putting you in.

311
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:56,690
And that's to stop Shidou.

312
00:20:57,170 --> 00:21:00,860
Understood, I already tried playing as a defender in the training camp.

313
00:21:01,310 --> 00:21:04,070
...And I also watched the match carefully as you told me.

314
00:21:04,950 --> 00:21:08,540
...Especially the abilities of our opponent's defenders.

315
00:21:09,420 --> 00:21:11,120
...Shidou and Itoshi Sae.

316
00:21:12,080 --> 00:21:14,600
...I won't let either of them out of my sight.

317
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,230
...He's still dribbling.

318
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:20,000
...He hasn't made his move yet.

319
00:21:21,050 --> 00:21:21,880
...Not yet.

320
00:21:23,580 --> 00:21:24,550
...Here it comes.

321
00:21:25,220 --> 00:21:25,880
The synergy is coming!

322
00:21:41,950 --> 00:21:44,720
...Those... are my movements!

323
00:21:45,620 --> 00:21:48,730
Copied with 99% accuracy!

324
00:21:50,190 --> 00:21:53,870
...This is my role in this match!

325
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:57,730
...To be the chameleon of the defense!

326
00:21:58,900 --> 00:22:01,670
You were amazing, Reo! You're incredible!

327
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:05,180
...I'll use this power of mine...

328
00:22:06,230 --> 00:22:08,180
...to bury Shidou!

329
00:23:40,530 --> 00:23:43,390
Blue Lock: Additional Time!

330
00:23:44,730 --> 00:23:47,750
Do you watch a lot of football matches, Isagi-san?

331
00:23:47,750 --> 00:23:53,490
Not at all! We don't understand football at all, we're just supporting Yoichi as his parents!

332
00:23:53,490 --> 00:23:54,750
Just like you!

333
00:23:54,750 --> 00:23:58,510
I still don't understand how that offside thing works!

334
00:23:58,510 --> 00:23:59,620
So true!

335
00:23:59,620 --> 00:24:02,080
Truly an eternal mystery!

336
00:24:02,080 --> 00:24:03,370
Isn't it?

337
00:24:04,380 --> 00:24:09,110
And let me say again, I'm so grateful that your son gets along with Meguru!

338
00:24:09,110 --> 00:24:10,880
...Because he doesn't have many friends.

339
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:15,300
You're welcome, it's nothing! Actually, we're the ones who should thank you, the same goes for Yoichi!

340
00:24:15,300 --> 00:24:18,320
Really? What is Yoichi-kun like?

341
00:24:18,630 --> 00:24:21,720
...In short... he's a coward.

342
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:23,310
Really?! Why do you say that?

343
00:24:23,310 --> 00:24:27,900
...Once, while playing in the park, he suddenly started crying with his hand on his head.

344
00:24:27,900 --> 00:24:31,490
...It turned out he was just scared of a rain that only existed in his imagination.

345
00:24:31,490 --> 00:24:34,740
...That's why I say... he's very cowardly and very sensitive.

346
00:24:35,870 --> 00:24:38,360
How wonderful that he can feel and perceive such a thing!

347
00:24:38,360 --> 00:24:40,370
Yoichi-kun is a genius!

348
00:24:40,370 --> 00:24:42,310
My son is the complete opposite.

349
00:24:42,310 --> 00:24:45,360
...When he sees other children coloring the sun red or yellow, he says to them:

350
00:24:45,360 --> 00:24:51,050
"How strange you are! Isn't the sun white? Look, it's white!" And he immediately gets into a fight!

351
00:24:51,050 --> 00:24:52,750
Also, he always walks around naked.

352
00:24:52,750 --> 00:24:56,050
Really?! My son also completely undresses!

353
00:24:56,050 --> 00:25:01,290
He takes off his clothes and complains that the friction gives him a weird feeling!

354
00:25:01,900 --> 00:25:05,210
Then our sons are nudity friends!

355
00:25:05,210 --> 00:25:06,060
...Exactly!

356
00:25:07,310 --> 00:25:09,460
Still, I'm happy he plays football.

357
00:25:09,460 --> 00:25:13,360
Thanks to that, he made friends, and we got to know each other as well.

358
00:25:13,360 --> 00:25:17,170
Yes... I hope for a long-lasting friendship!

359
00:25:17,170 --> 00:25:18,820
There you are!

360
00:25:18,820 --> 00:25:22,370
...The second half is about to start! We need to get back to our seats!

361
00:25:27,670 --> 00:25:29,340
...What a disaster!

362
00:25:30,710 --> 00:25:34,170
...A-Amazing synergy!